    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d106-a1">

                <pb facs="0138" n="64" sameAs="frus:frus1865p2/pg64"/>

                <head>Viscount Monck to Mr.
                        Burnley</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Quebec,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-01-31"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >January</hi> 31, 1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to your despatches of October 16
                    and November 30 and their enclosures, I have the honor to inform you, for
                    communication to the Secretary of State of the United States, that I have issued
                    my warrant for the extradition of Bennet G. Burley, charged with the crime of
                    robbery within the jurisdiction of the United States.</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>MONCK.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>J. H. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Burnley,</hi> Esq.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
